  "summary": "The complete Q5 local-extremum classification is proved: modulo signed coordinate permutations, the locally extremal central sections are exactly d1, d2, and d5. The unique non-diagonal full-support critical orbit and the support-four (1,1,2,2,0) orbit are saddles. Exact certificates cover all six full-support chambers, all walls, and supports 1 through 4. The 23-check primary master suite, 17-input independent audit, hostile full referee, and release-delta referee all pass; independent mutations and parser attacks are rejected. Citation/BibTeX audits, two clean builds, archive extraction/rebuild, manifest checks, and 8/8 pagewise PDF inspection pass. Confidence is 99 rather than 100 because the exact proof is machine-assisted but not formalized in an interactive proof assistant. A publishable PDF and clean source ZIP are retained under release/.",
